  "description": "When Seo Nayeong, a shy, introverted college girl, joined her university’s board game club “Playmate,” she was looking forward to friendly seniors and some wholesome fun. And at first, everything seemed just what she expected—perfectly innocent, that is, until the club revealed its true face. What began as harmless fun escalates into increasingly explicit and boundary-pushing penalties. Trapped in a high-stakes game of temptation, Nayeong finds herself confronting secret desires that she never knew existed.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
